{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1698117141"}, "name":{"label":"Miathegoat2532"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-31T14:14:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.10"}, "id":{"label":"13578590487"}, "title":{"label":"Did not work"}, "content":{"label":"This game is extremely frustrating because it does not properly sync with my TikTok account, which makes it basically unplayable. No matter how many times I try to connect my TikTok or refresh the app, it keeps saying that I need more likes, even though I am very active on TikTok and clearly meet the requirements. I am on TikTok constantly, engaging with content, liking posts, and interacting daily, yet the game still does not recognize any of that activity. Because of this, I am locked out of features and unable to progress at all. The app gives no clear explanation or solution, and there is no helpful support to fix the problem. It feels misleading and poorly designed, especially since the game heavily relies on TikTok integration to function. Until the syncing issue is fixed and the game accurately reflects real TikTok activity, I would not recommend this app to anyone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6742410648&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
