{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1606440742"}, "name":{"label":"Adelaide Ivory"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-28T19:57:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.10"}, "id":{"label":"13567372607"}, "title":{"label":"Fun, but quite poorly made"}, "content":{"label":"The one game mode that does work (WhoLiked) is actually so much fun. My only complaint is that the TikTok’s are very loud, so if you are on a call, it’s hard to hear your friends talking. I wish there was a volume setting that you could turn up/turn down mid game. My real big problem with this app is that the other modes, like Who Reposted and Who Saved just straight up don’t work. It keeps saying that I need to repost more things, which I know is not true because I repost basically everything. This app definitely has a lot of potential but there are a lot of bugs that make it unfun, like the lack of other modes.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6742410648&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
